Here's the problem file for putting books on the shelf:

```pddl
(define (problem put_books_on_shelf)
  (:domain robot4)
  (:objects
    robot4 - robot
    Book - object
    Shelf - object
    CoffeeTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot4 CoffeeTable)
    (at-location Book CoffeeTable)
    (not (inaction robot4))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location Book Shelf)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.